        "en": "Muhammad ibn Ali Majiluyah (may God be pleased with him) narrated that Muhammad ibn Yahya al-Attar quoted Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn Yahya, on the authority of Ahmad ibn Muhammad al-Sayyari who linked it up through a chain of narrators to Abu Hamzah al-Thamali, from Ali ibn al-Hussein (peace be upon them both)."
